{#
| Variable                   | Type   | Description                                         |
|----------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------------------------|
| component                  | object | merchant settings from twilight.json                |
| component.badge            | string | glass/pill badge text                               |
| component.heading          | string | heading — first part                                |
| component.heading_highlight| string | heading — highlighted part (royal-blue on mobile)   |
| component.subtitle         | string | supporting line under the heading                   |
| component.note             | string | small note above the email field                    |
| component.email_placeholder| string | email input placeholder                             |
| component.button_text      | string | subscribe button label                              |
| component.image            | string | desktop product image (merchant upload)             |
| position                   | int    | sorting block                                       |

Figma: desktop 6036:5326 (1440) — royal-blue card, product image LEFT, white text RIGHT.
       mobile  6036:14322 (428) — baby-blue card, NO image, dark text, stacked.

Newsletter behaviour: this theme has no Salla newsletter web-component or `salla.newsletter`
API, so the form is intentionally VISUAL-ONLY and inert (submit is prevented). Subscription
handling is PENDING a real, safe mechanism — no fake backend flow is wired here.
#}
<section class="s-block qfnews" id="qfnews-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qfnews__card">

            {# product image — desktop only (Figma hides it on mobile); merchant image field #}
            {% if component.image %}
                <div class="qfnews__media">
                    <img src="{{ component.image }}" alt="{{ component.heading }}" loading="lazy"/>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            {# content (right in the layout) #}
            <div class="qfnews__content">

                {% if component.badge %}
                    <span class="qfnews__badge">{{ component.badge }}</span>
                {% endif %}

                {% if component.heading or component.heading_highlight %}
                    <div class="qfnews__head">
                        <h2 class="qfnews__title">
                            {%- if component.heading %}{{ component.heading }} {% endif -%}
                            {%- if component.heading_highlight %}<span class="qfnews__title-em">{{ component.heading_highlight }}</span>{% endif -%}
                        </h2>
                        {% if component.subtitle %}
                            <p class="qfnews__subtitle">{{ component.subtitle }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

                {# visual-only form — submission is prevented (see note above) #}
                <form class="qfnews__form" onsubmit="return false;" novalidate>
                    {% if component.note %}
                        <p class="qfnews__note">{{ component.note }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="qfnews__field">
                        <input
                            type="email"
                            class="qfnews__input"
                            placeholder="{{ component.email_placeholder }}"
                            aria-label="{{ component.email_placeholder }}"
                            autocomplete="email"
                        />
                        <button type="submit" class="qfnews__btn">{{ component.button_text }}</button>

                    </div>
                </form>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
